`sysmon` EventCode=1 Image="*\\cmd.exe" CommandLine="*timeout*" CommandLine="*del /f /q*"
| stats count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by ComputerName, ParentImage, CommandLine
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
Self-Deletion via CMD Timeout and Del
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1070.004 (Indicator Removal: File Deletion)

Malware delays then force-deletes its own binary to avoid
forensic recovery. The timeout allows the parent process
to release the file handle before deletion.
```
